  "text": "**TASK_098 - Biome Parser Fix**\n\n**Issue origin:** User reported Biome lint validation showing no feedback in webhook-router project but TypeScript validation worked fine.\n\n**Key debugging insights:**\n- Both projects getting same Biome verbose output\n- Hook WAS running and capturing output\n- Parser WAS finding errors but extracting garbage (box chars)\n- File path filtering silently dropped all errors (absolute vs relative path mismatch)\n\n**Files to watch:**\n- `src/lib/lint-parsers.ts` - Complex multiline parsing logic\n- `src/hooks/edit-validation.ts` - Output capture from both success and error\n\n**Potential future issues:**\n- If Biome changes output format again, parser will need updates\n- Current detection relies on box char presence (━, ×, ✖)\n- Could be more robust with format version detection\n\n**Test coverage notes:**\n- lint-parsers.test.ts now has good edge case coverage\n- Should add test for Biome format version changes if they announce breaking changes",
  "sections": [
    "Project Notes"
  ],
